1
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Ey quyoshli, hur o‘lkam, elga baxt, najot ber!

2
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Sen o‘zing do‘stlarga yo‘ldosh, mehribon!

3
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Yashnagay ilm-u fan, ijod abadiy!

4
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:39,000
Yor bo‘lsin shuhrating, toki bor jahon!

5
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Oltin bu vodiylar — jon O‘zbekiston

6
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:59,000
Ajdodlar mardona ruhi senga yor!

7
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:04,000
Ulug‘ xalq qudrati jo‘sh urgan zamon

8
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:13,000
Olamni mahliyo aylagan diyor!

9
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:24,000
Bag‘ri keng o‘zbekning o‘chmas iymoni

10
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:35,000
Erkin, yosh avlodlar senga zo‘r qanot!

11
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:42,000
Istiqlol mash’ali, tinchlik posboni

12
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:49,000
Haqsevar, ona yurt, mangu bo‘l obod!

13
00:01:49,000 --> 00:02:00,000
Oltin bu vodiylar — jon O‘zbekiston

14
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:09,000
Ajdodlar mardona ruhi senga yor!

15
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:15,000
Ulug‘ xalq qudrati jo‘sh urgan zamon

16
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:24,000
Olamni mahliyo aylagan diyor!
